@1 Players Online=@1 名玩家在线
Owner Section: Here you can monitor server activity=服主区域：您可以在这里监控服务器活动
Enjoy the server!=享受服务器吧！
For a complete list of available commands, type @1 into chat.=要查看所有可用命令，请在聊天中输入 @1。
Show the welcome screen again=再次显示欢迎界面
Player not found.=未找到玩家。
@1 SERVER RULES=@1 服务器规则
You have @1 seconds to accept.=您有 @1 秒的时间接受。
If you close this window without accepting, then you will have a @1 minute penalty.=如果您未接受就关闭此窗口，您将受到 @1 分钟的处罚。
You are temporarily penalized. Wait @1 seconds.=您暂时受到处罚。请等待 @1 秒。
Force player to accept rules=强制玩家接受规则
Usage: /rule <player>=用法：/rule <player>
I Accept=我接受
Rules sent to @1=规则已发送给 @1
You closed the rules window. You are penalized for @1 minutes.=您关闭了规则窗口。您将受到 @1 分钟的处罚。
@1 accepted the rules.=@1 接受了规则。
You did not accept the rules. You are penalized for @1 minutes.=您没有接受规则。您将受到 @1 分钟的处罚。
Show rules=显示规则
Close=关闭
Shows Guardian rank requirements=显示 Guardian 等级要求
Use @1 to view the server rules=使用 @1 查看服务器规则
Do NOT steal from other players.=禁止偷窃其他玩家的物品。
Do NOT place lava or water on other players' areas.=禁止在其他玩家的区域放置岩浆或水。
Do NOT build on someone else's claimed area.=禁止在其他玩家已认领的区域建造。
Do NOT steal protected areas or land.=禁止盗取受保护的区域或土地。
Do NOT use modified or hacked clients.=禁止使用修改版或作弊客户端。
No insults, swearing, or offensive language.=禁止侮辱、咒骂或使用冒犯性语言。
Do NOT advertise other servers.=禁止宣传其他服务器。
Respect all players, especially Moderators and Staff.=尊重所有玩家，尤其是管理员和工作人员。
Do NOT ask for privileges or ranks (Moderator, Staff, Guardian).=禁止索要权限或等级（管理员、工作人员、守护者）。
Moderator and Staff ranks are only given when applications are officially opened.=管理员和工作人员等级仅在正式开放申请时授予。
Do NOT place lava or water at spawn.=禁止在出生点放置岩浆或水。
Dating or looking for relationships inside the server is strictly forbidden.=严禁在服务器内约会或寻找恋爱关系。
Do NOT provoke fights or unnecessary arguments.=禁止挑起争斗或不必要的争吵。
Do NOT harass or annoy other players repeatedly.=禁止反复骚扰或打扰其他玩家。
Do NOT spam in chat.=禁止在聊天中刷屏。
Do NOT write everything in ALL CAPS.=禁止全部使用大写字母书写。
Do NOT spread false information to confuse others.=禁止传播虚假信息误导他人。
Do NOT build inappropriate or offensive structures.=禁止建造不当或冒犯性的建筑。
Do NOT destroy abandoned constructions without staff permission.=未经工作人员许可，禁止破坏废弃建筑。
Do NOT make traps that harm other players unfairly.=禁止制作不公平伤害其他玩家的陷阱。
Do NOT create lag machines or mechanisms that affect server performance.=禁止制造卡顿机器或影响服务器性能的装置。
Keep spawn and claimed areas tidy and aesthetically organized.=保持出生点和已认领区域整洁、美观、有序。
Do NOT exploit server bugs.=禁止利用服务器漏洞。
Do NOT duplicate items under any circumstances.=任何情况下都禁止复制物品。
Report bugs to Staff instead of exploiting them.=请向工作人员报告漏洞，而不是利用它们。
Do NOT scam other players in trades.=禁止在交易中欺骗其他玩家。
Owner decisions are final.=服主的决定为最终决定。
Do NOT publicly argue against punishments in chat.=禁止在聊天中公开争论处罚决定。
Report Staff issues to the Owner.=请向服主报告工作人员的问题。
Impersonating Staff will result in immediate punishment.=冒充工作人员将受到立即处罚。
Do NOT share your account with others.=禁止与他人共享您的账户。
Do NOT ask for others' passwords.=禁止索要他人的密码。
Each player is responsible for their account security.=每位玩家都应对自己的账户安全负责。
Keep a friendly and safe environment for everyone.=为所有人保持友好、安全的环境。
Do NOT post +18 or inappropriate content.=禁止发布 18+ 或不适当的内容。
Romantic or inappropriate roleplay is forbidden.=禁止恋爱或不适当的角色扮演。
